Name: Insert 'create_aftable' template
Description: Insert at the cursor a template for create_aftable() from the
    'aftables' package, pre-filled with demo data.
Binding: at_template_aftable
Interactive: false

Name: Insert full 'aftables' template workflow
Description: Insert at the cursor (a) demo templates for cover, contents and
notes tables, and (b) create_aftable(), pre-filled with demo data.
Binding: at_template_workflow
Interactive: false
